y liked your outfit designs and I would love to request you to draw something similar to an outfit you’ve previous drew for someone for my OCs ^^\nMy two OCs are Raven and Cain, they are a couple! I would like them both to have a military uniforms, but I want Raven's uniform to be white while Cain's uniform black. Please keep the chains, Raven’s glasses, cross motifs, and Cain's wing and corrupted arm included in their outfits! And give Raven a short or skirt in their outfit. I apologize if this is too complicated please cancel if it's too much. Also, feel free to request a resend if the amount is not fair. The references are below as well as the outfit you’ve drew before! Thank you for considering my request~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_MXetMSp-qU2zvX13J1EmOFfJCGb-7Cm?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xehThU4YABRse4qN1LZtpTjbWIKHq53i?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://x.com/zettai_nagaiki/status/1916403082944041121", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zettai_nagaiki/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/59fbca73/uploads/origins/6379c13c-2cd1-4254-bbc3-2909c3455740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dd15a375ed7683218a5a7ef3565e67d8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59fbca73/uploads/origins/6379c13c-2cd1-4254-bbc3-2909c3455740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dd15a375ed7683218a5a7ef3565e67d8, https://si.imgix.net/59fbca73/uploads/origins/6379c13c-2cd1-4254-bbc3-2909c3455740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f3f27040db4f410c66df939cbdd2b6e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59fbca73/uploads/origins/6379c13c-2cd1-42